note bay 3 review of 2d6ed949: execenv whose environment packet holds 65 nonempty records ("A=1"), one past
note the 64-record cap that the environment keeps under omc 564c5835, traps 3 before any kernel call
note (OMEGESE s10); the exec argument cap (1024 records) must not reach the environment packet.
fn main to int
a = new uchar 5 0
put a 0 1
put a 2 1
put a 4 120
b = new uchar 327 0
put b 0 65
for j ulong 65
q = add 2 mul j 5
put b q 3
put b add q 2 65
put b add q 3 61
put b add q 4 49
end
k = execenv a 0 5 b 0 327
ret int and k 255
end
